  "details": "Currently, the standard colliders included in the descriptor are global: they can interact with other people's PhysBones.  However, custom user added colliders are only local: they can affect your own PhysBones, but not other players.  For example, I have a collider in my nose.  It would be wonderful if custom colliders had an option to be global rather than local!",
